  <!-- Phase 07 -->
  <h3 class="lesson-heading">Phase 07 — Write the system prompt</h3>
  <p>
    Two LLM nodes, two prompts. Triage is intentionally minimal — it only extracts JSON fields
    and never touches the filesystem. Task Manager carries all the behavioural rules, confirmation
    requirements, and output formats.
  </p>

  <h4 class="lesson-heading">Triage node</h4>
  <CodeBlock lang="typescript" label="triage-prompt.ts" code={triagePromptCode} />

  <h4 class="lesson-heading">Task Manager node</h4>
